<!-- Every sentence can also take a <Sound> node that defaults to the sound folder path.
	 Emergency means the chat will always be displayed, Background means it has a 20% chance to be displayed.
	 After a background chat is sent there is a delay between 180 and 270 seconds before that same chat can be sent.
	 This delay is hardcoded to 180 seconds and then there is a random number between 0 and 50% of the delay that gets added to it
	 If you want to override the delay use config AIChatDelay=your number -->
